!revision/aai_r1/results/checkpoints/*.pt
!checkpoints/*.json
!checkpoints/*.md
!checkpoints/MANIFEST.sha256
# PEINN's final head and calibrator are released as byte parts; the joined .pt (python -m v21r assemble) stays local
revision/aai_r1/results/checkpoints/final/*.pt
